{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"日本名作家村上龍逝世　享年74歲　與村上春樹並稱「村上雙傑」\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/JP-RIP-261023-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】日本著名作家村上龍逝世，享年74歲。</p><p>村上龍與村上春樹並稱為「村上雙傑」，共同引領日本文壇村上龍的作品，風格前衛及充滿感官衝擊，代表作包括《接近無限透明的藍》及《寄物櫃的嬰孩》。</p><p>村上龍亦曾經擔任電影導演及編劇，並積極就政經議題發聲，他本月17日在家中逝世，享年74歲。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:03:56.000490+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:28:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:19.142323+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:58:23.879165+00:00","content_hash":"f57a6b0dfdd8df9a52c1e6e9110d06ce252b7315a9430a7ca66b6aaedc876394","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}